; Beam68 catalog description (CatComp/FlexCat format).
; Launcher user interface.  IDs are permanent: append new strings only.
; Regenerate with scripts/make-catalog.py.
;
MSG_HELP_APP_TITLE (1//)
Application search
MSG_HELP_APP (2//)
app:<text> searches tools and executables
MSG_HELP_FILE_TITLE (3//)
File search
MSG_HELP_FILE (4//)
file:<text> searches indexed files
MSG_HELP_DRAWER_TITLE (5//)
Drawer search
MSG_HELP_DRAWER (6//)
drawer:<text> searches indexed drawers
MSG_HELP_PLUGIN_TITLE (7//)
Plugin search
MSG_HELP_PLUGIN (8//)
